{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07083","headline":"巡去岳阳却归鄂州使院留别郑洵侍御先曾谪居此州 · 刘长卿","name":"巡去岳阳却归鄂州使院留别郑洵侍御先曾谪居此州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事长沙谪，相逢楚水秋。\n暮帆归夏口，寒雨对巴丘。\n帝子椒浆奠，骚人木叶愁。\n惟怜万里外，离别洞庭头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}